        "t_17": "Audiovisual Systems Architect",
        "t_18": "& Generative AI Integration Specialist",
        "t_19": "Strategic fusion between analog sound engineering and the cutting edge of Generative AI. Three decades leading critical infrastructures in film, TV and urban environments.",
        "t_20": "Higher Degree Official Accreditation",
        "t_21": "Web Apps API Developer",
        "t_22": "Continuity Operator & CCU",
        "t_23": "Active Partner SGAE / AISGE / AEDYP / AIE",
        "t_24": "Run Technical Environment",
        "t_25": "See Audited Track Record",
        "t_26": "The Origin of the Avant-garde",
        "t_27": "About the Hybrid Profile",
        "t_28": "Leadership in the contemporary audiovisual industry requires a perfect symbiosis between traditional technical craft and mastery in the governance of algorithms. True value comes when experience gained in real analog environments is transferred to training and directing next-generation neural networks.",
        "t_29": "My career organically unites both worlds. I have been part of the very foundations of urban culture in Spain: from recording the first Rap LP released entirely in the country with BZN MCs, to co-founding the national advanced music scene by actively participating in the first Sónar Festival in 1994. I have operated in the maximum range of daily television audience controlling direct sound and musical montage for 16 years and 8 consecutive seasons at Gestmusic Endemol, and I have audited, restored and mastered audio for the most demanding global streaming platforms in the world, such as Netflix, HBO, Amazon Prime and public channels such as TV3 and TVE1.",
        "t_30": "I don't just embrace emerging technology superficially; I design the underlying technical architecture that dominates it, ensuring an optimal broadcast standard, absolute stability in live environments and rigorous legal protection.",
        "t_31": "Lab Prototyping",
        "t_32": "Own Development and Automation Ecosystem",
        "t_33": "Design and integration of proprietary software ecosystems through API architectures and advanced multimedia processing models. Three years of R&D applied to the automation of complex flows in production companies, forensic audio systems and high-performance cinematographic environments.",
        "t_34": "Studio Pro Suite",
        "t_35": "v1.0.0 Stable",
        "t_36": "Modular desktop ecosystem built with Electron and React. It integrates advanced video editing tools, massive image processing and a DAW console for audio mastering.",
        "t_37": "High-performance local architecture for comprehensive management of audiovisual post-production and multi-format conversion.",
        "t_38": "Cinema Station Pro",
        "t_39": "v1.0.0 Stable",
        "t_40": "Cinematic pipeline accelerated by FastAPI and FFmpeg. It allows dynamic injection of professional LUTs (.cube), real-time colorimetry manipulation and high-efficiency transcoding.",
        "t_41": "Broadcast-level video processing with concurrent support and fallback to Redis queues.",
        "t_42": "Brand Music Curator",
        "t_43": "v1.0.0 Stable",
        "t_44": "AI-assisted music curation engine (multi-modal LLM). Generates sound identity strategies for retail, neural synthetic voiceovers and playlists based on the commercial target.",
        "t_45": "Complete integration with Express.js gateway, predictive audience analysis and synthesis of advertising spots.",
        "t_46": "Featured Case Studies",
        "t_47": "chus_bzn_lab$",
        "t_48": "AV Processing, Scaling and Restoration:",
        "t_49": "LLM Audio, Voice and Video Models:",
        "t_50": "Audiovisual Solvency",
        "t_51": "Audiovisual Engineering and Broadcast Operations 360°",
        "t_52": "Absolute deployment capacity in any link of the audiovisual technical chain, with the audited technical solvency required by large television networks and international distribution platforms.",
        "t_53": "AV Production and Technical Direction",
        "t_54": "Architecture and monitoring of AV signal continuity in real time. Leadership in making critical decisions for complex performance controls, live broadcasts and highly available corporate streaming ecosystems.",
        "t_55": "High End Sound Postproduction",
        "t_56": "Advanced sound design and mixing engineering with a focus on technical excellence. Rigorous compliance with international loudness standards (EBU R128) for the most demanding OTT platforms and television channels in the global market.",
        "t_57": "Multimedia Management and Automation",
        "t_58": "Management and synchronization of scenic elements, lighting and video. Expert mastery of automation systems (QLab/OBS) to guarantee millimetric technical execution aligned with the production schedule.",
        "t_59": "Camera Operator & CCU",
        "t_60": "High precision operation in optical collection systems. Real-time colorimetry control, exposure management and critical white balance using CCU units in highly demanding broadcast environments.",
        "t_61": "Professional DJ & Live Performer",
        "t_62": "Design, programming and execution of advanced music sessions and multimedia events for multinational corporations. Expert operation of high-end professional hardware (Pioneer DDJ1000 / Rekordbox), adapting the acoustics of complex rooms and managing large live music libraries.",
        "t_63": "Competence Audit",
        "t_64": "Official Qualifications (FPCAT System)",
        "t_65": "Professional qualification officially certified and audited by the Public Agency for Training and Qualification Professionals of Catalonia. Full accreditation of 14 units of competence (UC) distributed in three levels:",
        "t_66": "LEVEL 3 (Higher Degree)",
        "t_67": "Sound for Audiovisuals and Shows",
        "t_68": "Planning, budget definition and comprehensive technical supervision of sound projects for high-impact productions and live events.",
        "t_69": "LEVELS 2 AND 1",
        "t_70": "Musical/Visual Animation and Image",
        "t_71": "Specialist in the installation of sound/lighting hardware, live mixing and digital image editing/processing.",
        "t_72": "// ADDITIONAL CERTIFICATIONS IN ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE",
        "t_73": "[Diploma — From 0 to Agents with AI]",
        "t_74": "[Diploma — Vibe Coding with AI]",
        "t_75": "Industrial Timeline",
        "t_76": "Historical Work History",
        "t_77": "More than 33 years of audited professional career guarantee a career characterized by job stability, leadership of technical teams and constant technological evolution.",
        "t_78": "2020 - PRESENT",
