        "t_80": "Actuara12 (Freelance / Proprietary Laboratory)",
        "t_81": "Technical leadership in the direction of corporate events and film productions. Specialist in the implementation of disruptive workflows through AI, advanced CCU control and design of sound architectures for large audiences.",
        "t_82": "Technology Specialist",
        "t_83": "Apple Computers",
        "t_84": "Solutions architecture and high-level technological consulting. Specialized support for the creative and corporate sector in Barcelona.",
        "t_85": "Sound Designer & Musical Editor",
        "t_86": "Visiona TV / TV3 / TVE1",
        "t_87": "Responsible for the design of the sound environment, post-production and mixing for the program “Dinàmiks” (TV3) and musical editor for national entertainment formats such as “Juego de Ninos” (TVE1) with Javier Sardà.",
        "t_88": "Senior Dubbing Technician",
