        "t_92": "General technical direction of the first professional freestyle battles organized in nationally renowned venues such as Razzmatazz. Coordination of multimedia filming with specialized technical teams.",
        "t_93": "1990 - 2006 (16 Years in Regular Staff)",
        "t_94": "Audiovisual Technician & Principal Musical Editor",
