        "t_service_dj_desc": "Direction and execution of advanced music sessions for festivals, corporate macro events and sound identity of commercial venues.",
        "t_service_dj_specs": "<strong>Commercial Solution & Deliverables:</strong><br/>• Operation with high-end Pioneer professional hardware (DDJ1000 / Rekordbox).<br/>• Room acoustic study and exclusive studio remixes adapted to the profile of the event.<br/>• <strong>Client application:</strong> Large format events, brand conventions and record production.",
