        "t_service_formacion_code": "// DOSSIER 07 – VIDEO TRAINING",
        "t_service_formacion_desc": "Courses, tutorials and onboarding videos so your team learns and grows, in a clear format that is easy to watch and understand.",
        "t_service_formacion_specs": "<strong>Solution & Deliverables:</strong><br/>• On-demand training pieces: onboarding, product tutorials and internal training.<br/>• Production supported by AI and adapted to your team's level.<br/>• <strong>Application:</strong> train without stopping operations and review the content whenever you need.",
        "t_service_formacion_title": "Video training",
        "t_service_ia_code": "// DOSSIER 08 – AI FOR YOUR COMMUNICATION",
        "t_service_ia_desc": "We implement AI in your company to produce more content in less time: catalogue, ads, avatars and workflows, with legal protection.",
        "t_service_ia_specs": "<strong>Solution & Deliverables:</strong><br/>• EU AI Act compliance and voice rights: legal security included.<br/>• From a single original source we produce catalogue, ads and derived pieces.<br/>• <strong>Application:</strong> lower cost and content in seconds, without losing your brand image.",
        "t_service_ia_title": "AI for your communication",
        "t_service_sonido_code": "// DOSSIER 05 – SOUND & MUSIC FOR YOUR BRAND",
        "t_service_sonido_desc": "Sound identity, jingles, voice-over and mixes with the quality of major productions. Also live music for your events and venues.",
        "t_service_sonido_specs": "<strong>Solution & Deliverables:</strong><br/>• EBU R128 mixing and mastering: your content sounds great on every platform.<br/>• The «sound of your brand»: consistent jingles, themes and voice-overs across everything you publish.<br/>• <strong>Application:</strong> sound identity, ambient music, DJ sets and remixes for large-format events.",
        "t_service_sonido_title": "Sound & music for your brand",
        "t_service_streaming_code": "// DOSSIER 03 – LIVE & STREAMING",
        "t_service_streaming_desc": "We cover your events, launches, open days and congresses live with broadcast quality and simultaneous streaming to your channels.",
        "t_service_streaming_specs": "<strong>Solution & Deliverables:</strong><br/>• Multi-camera, professional audio and real-time colour control.<br/>• Simultaneous streaming to several platforms without interruptions.<br/>• <strong>Application:</strong> your event watched by your audience in real time, with broadcast reliability.",
        "t_service_streaming_title": "Live & streaming",
        "t_service_video_code": "// DOSSIER 01 – CORPORATE VIDEO & DEMOS",
        "t_service_video_desc": "We present your company, product or team in a clear, professional video, with the image and sound quality of major productions.",
        "t_service_video_specs": "<strong>Solution & Deliverables:</strong><br/>• Multicamera shoot in studio or at your premises, in 4K/8K with cinema colour.<br/>• Script and direction focused on the client: a message understood in one minute.<br/>• <strong>Application:</strong> a demo that looks and sounds professional on your site, channels and sales meetings.",
        "t_service_video_title": "Corporate video & demo",
